invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: the trust hash leaves out the kind, so a PSK with the bytes of the
  pin that issued a ticket holds that ticket's trust. test/session_ticket_tests.h
  presents a ticket a pin named under a PSK of the same bytes, and requires
  CH_EINVAL.

--- old
    sha256_update(&s, &kind, 1);
--- new
    (void)kind;
